# Custom Domain Configuration for GitHub Pages / Static Hosting
# 
# To connect your own custom domain (e.g. curateless.tools or antibloat.io):
# 1. Rename this file to 'CNAME' (without .example) or copy it to 'public/CNAME'
# 2. Replace the domain below with your exact domain:
#
# yoursite.com
#
# 3. Configure your DNS provider:
#    - For apex domain (yoursite.com): Add 4 A Records pointing to GitHub Pages IPs:
#      185.199.108.153
#      185.199.109.153
#      185.199.110.153
#      185.199.111.153
#    - For subdomain (tools.yoursite.com): Add a CNAME record pointing to:
#      <your-github-username>.github.io
